   "text": "Item-1: #Title, #Attributes …   Item-2: #Title, #Attributes …\nAnalyze the potential correlation: semantic (similar concepts\nor uses) or complementary purchase (bought or used together).\ne.g. (fishing rod, parasol): highly related usage scenarios\nReply <answer>Yes</answer> or <answer>No</answer>.",
